WEBVTT

00:00:00.176 --> 00:00:01.803
Sorry.

00:00:02.011 --> 00:00:05.932
The sorting ceremony
will begin momentarily.

00:00:07.308 --> 00:00:10.603
It's true then,
what they're saying on the train.

00:00:11.062 --> 00:00:13.690
Harry Potter has come to Hogwarts.

00:00:13.898 --> 00:00:15.316
Harry Potter?

00:00:15.942 --> 00:00:18.611
This is crabbe and goyle.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.114
And I'm Malfoy.

00:00:21.447 --> 00:00:23.783
Draco Malfoy.

00:00:25.743 --> 00:00:29.330
Think my name's funny, do you?
I've no need to ask yours.

00:00:29.539 --> 00:00:35.336
Red hair and a hand-me-down robe?
You must be a Weasley.

00:00:36.254 --> 00:00:40.299
You'll find out some wizarding families
are better than others.

00:00:40.466 --> 00:00:44.303
You don't want to go making friends
with the wrong sort.

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:46.639
I can help you there.

00:00:48.891 --> 00:00:52.729
I think I can tell the wrong sort
for myself, thanks.

00:00:58.359 --> 00:01:00.570
We're ready for you now.
Follow me.

00:01:19.172 --> 00:01:23.676
The ceiling isn't real. It's bewitched
to look like the night sky.

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:26.888
I read about it
in Hogwarts, a history.

00:01:40.151 --> 00:01:42.987
Will you wait along here, please?

00:01:44.405 --> 00:01:47.200
Now, before we begin...

00:01:47.408 --> 00:01:50.661
Professor Dumbledore would like
to say a few words.

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:55.666
I have a few start-of-term notices
I wish to announce.

00:01:56.042 --> 00:01:58.169
The first years, please note...

00:01:58.461 --> 00:02:04.467
That the dark forest is
strictly forbidden to all students.

00:02:04.717 --> 00:02:10.223
Also, our caretaker, Mr. Filch,
has asked me to remind you...

00:02:10.431 --> 00:02:15.061
That the third-floor corridor
is out of bounds...

00:02:15.353 --> 00:02:19.565
To everyone who does not wish
to die a most painful death.

00:02:20.942 --> 00:02:22.902
Thank you.

00:02:24.654 --> 00:02:28.741
When I call your name,
you will come forth.

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:32.578
I shall place the sorting hat
on your head...

00:02:32.745 --> 00:02:35.998
And you will be sorted
into your houses.

00:02:36.207 --> 00:02:38.835
Hermione Granger.

00:02:41.087 --> 00:02:43.714
Oh, no. Okay, relax.

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:47.468
Mental, that one, I'm telling you.

00:02:51.973 --> 00:02:56.769
Ah, right, then. Mm, right.

00:02:57.019 --> 00:03:00.606
Okay. Gryffindor!

00:03:09.407 --> 00:03:12.201
Draco Malfoy.

00:03:16.747 --> 00:03:18.958
Slytherin!

00:03:19.917 --> 00:03:22.795
Every wizard who went bad
was in Slytherin.

00:03:23.045 --> 00:03:25.590
Susan bones.

00:03:32.555 --> 00:03:33.973
Ah!

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:36.267
Harry, what is it?

00:03:36.517 --> 00:03:39.228
Nothing. Nothing, I'm fine.

00:03:39.478 --> 00:03:40.897
Sorting hat: Let's see...

00:03:41.147 --> 00:03:45.484
I know! Hufflepuff!

00:03:47.236 --> 00:03:49.655
Ronald Weasley.

00:04:02.501 --> 00:04:08.507
Ha, another Weasley!
I know just what to do with you.

00:04:09.175 --> 00:04:11.510
Gryffindor!

00:04:17.683 --> 00:04:20.186
Harry Potter.

00:04:37.328 --> 00:04:41.290
Hm, difficult, very difficult.

00:04:41.499 --> 00:04:45.461
Plenty of courage, I see.
Not a bad mind, either.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.964
There's talent, oh, yes.

00:04:48.172 --> 00:04:52.009
And a thirst to prove yourself.

00:04:52.218 --> 00:04:54.387
But where to put you?

00:04:54.971 --> 00:04:57.473
Not Slytherin, not Slytherin!

00:04:57.723 --> 00:05:01.352
Not Slytherin, eh? Are you sure?

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:06.399
You could be great, you know.
It's all here, in your head.

00:05:06.649 --> 00:05:11.988
And Slytherin will help you on the way
to greatness, no doubt about that.

00:05:12.321 --> 00:05:16.909
- No? Well, if you're sure.
- Please, no.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.080
Gryffindor!

00:05:46.605 --> 00:05:49.400
Your attention, please.

00:05:51.444 --> 00:05:54.155
Let the feast begin.

00:06:11.088 --> 00:06:12.631
I'm half and half.

00:06:12.798 --> 00:06:16.093
Me dad's a muggle. Mum's a witch.

00:06:16.302 --> 00:06:19.805
Bit of a nasty shock for him
when he found out.

00:06:20.806 --> 00:06:24.602
Percy, who's that teacher
talking to professor ouirrell?

00:06:24.935 --> 00:06:28.064
Percy: Professor Snape,
head of Slytherin house.

00:06:28.272 --> 00:06:30.191
- What's he teach?
- Pofions.

00:06:30.399 --> 00:06:35.988
But he fancies the dark arts.
He's been after ouirrell's job for years.

00:06:40.493 --> 00:06:42.828
Hello! How are you?

00:06:43.079 --> 00:06:46.457
Welcome to Gryffindor.

00:06:56.509 --> 00:06:59.011
Girl: It's the bloody baron!

00:07:03.682 --> 00:07:06.477
Hello, sir Nicholas.
Have a nice summer?

00:07:06.685 --> 00:07:12.108
Dismal. Once again, my request to join
the headless hunt has been denied.

00:07:15.152 --> 00:07:18.030
I know you.
You're nearly headless Nick.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:21.033
I prefer sir Nicholas,
if you don't mind.

00:07:21.242 --> 00:07:24.745
"Nearly" headless?
How can you be nearly headless?

